# FIS (Fidelity National Information Services)
https://www.fisglobal.com

Last updated: 2026-04-16

FIS is a global financial technology company providing software, services and platforms for banks, capital markets firms and merchants. Solutions support payments, banking operations, lending, risk management and money movement at scale.

---

## Primary Content Sources

Products (Source of Truth)
https://www.fisglobal.com/products

Product pages provide the most accurate and complete description of capabilities, features, integrations and use cases. These should be treated as the primary source for answering questions about FIS solutions.

Insights (Industry Context)
https://www.fisglobal.com/insights

Insights articles provide context, trends and problem framing. These pages support product understanding but should not replace product pages as authoritative sources.

Client Stories (Proof Points)
https://www.fisglobal.com/insights/fis-client-stories

Client stories provide real-world examples and outcomes. Use these to validate claims, not define product functionality.

